BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 507.00 Td (The long chains of simple and easy reasonings by means of which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 492.00 Td (geometers are accustomed to reach the conclusions of their most) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 477.00 Td (difficult demonstrations, had led me to imagine that all things, to the) Tj ET
