BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 447.00 Td (same way, and that there is nothing so far removed from us as to be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 432.00 Td (beyond our reach, or so hidden that we cannot discover it, provided) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 417.00 Td (only we abstain from accepting the false for the true, and always) Tj ET
