BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 327.00 Td (sciences, the mathematicians alone have been able to find any) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 312.00 Td (demonstrations, that is, any certain and evident reasons, I did not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 297.00 Td (doubt but that such must have been the rule of their investigations. I) Tj ET
