BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 147.00 Td (proportions in the most general form possible, without referring them) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 132.00 Td (to any objects in particular, except such as would most facilitate the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 117.00 Td (knowledge of them, and without by any means restricting them to) Tj ET
