BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 252.00 Td (could not do better than continue in that in which I was engaged, viz.,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 237.00 Td (in devoting my whole life to the culture of my reason, and in making) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 222.00 Td (the greatest progress I was able in the knowledge of truth, on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 207.00 Td (principles of the method which I had prescribed to myself. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 192.00 Td (method, from the time I had begun to apply it, had been to me the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 177.00 Td (source of satisfaction so intense as to lead me to, believe that more) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 162.00 Td (perfect or more innocent could not be enjoyed in this life; and as by its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 147.00 Td (means I daily discovered truths that appeared to me of some) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 132.00 Td (importance, and of which other men were generally ignorant, the) Tj ET
