BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 516.10 Td (I am in doubt as to the propriety of making my first meditations in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 501.10 Td (place above mentioned matter of discourse; for these are so) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 486.10 Td (metaphysical, and so uncommon, as not, perhaps, to be acceptable to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 471.10 Td (every one. And yet, that it may be determined whether the foundations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 456.10 Td (that I have laid are sufficiently secure, I find myself in a measure) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 441.10 Td (constrained to advert to them. I had long before remarked that, in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 426.10 Td (relation to practice, it is sometimes necessary to adopt, as if above) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 411.10 Td (doubt, opinions which we discern to be highly uncertain, as has been) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 396.10 Td (already said; but as I then desired to give my attention solely to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 381.10 Td (search after truth, I thought that a procedure exactly the opposite was) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 366.10 Td (called for, and that I ought to reject as absolutely false all opinions in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 351.10 Td (regard to which I could suppose the least ground for doubt, in order to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 336.10 Td (ascertain whether after that there remained aught in my belief that was) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 321.10 Td (wholly indubitable. Accordingly, seeing that our senses sometimes) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 306.10 Td (deceive us, I was willing to suppose that there existed nothing really) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 291.10 Td (such as they presented to us; and because some men err in reasoning,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 276.10 Td (and fall into paralogisms, even on the simplest matters of geometry, I,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 261.10 Td (convinced that I was as open to error as any other, rejected as false all) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 246.10 Td (the reasonings I had hitherto taken for demonstrations; and finally,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 231.10 Td (when I considered that the very same thoughts \(presentations\) which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 216.10 Td (we experience when awake may also be experienced when we are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 201.10 Td (asleep, while there is at that time not one of them true, I supposed that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 186.10 Td (all the objects \(presentations\) that had ever entered into my mind) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 171.10 Td (when awake, had in them no more truth than the illusions of my) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 156.10 Td (dreams. But immediately upon this I observed that, whilst I thus) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 141.10 Td (wished to think that all was false, it was absolutely necessary that I,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 126.10 Td (who thus thought, should be somewhat; and as I observed that this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 111.10 Td (truth, I think, therefore I am \(COGITO ERGO SUM\), was so certain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 96.10 Td (and of such evidence that no ground of doubt, however extravagant,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 81.10 Td (could be alleged by the sceptics capable of shaking it, I concluded that) Tj ET
