BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 196.00 Td (matter, so that there resulted a chaos as disordered as the poets ever) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 181.00 Td (feigned, and after that did nothing more than lend his ordinary) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 166.00 Td (concurrence to nature, and allow her to act in accordance with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 151.00 Td (laws which he had established. On this supposition, I, in the first) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 136.00 Td (place, described this matter, and essayed to represent it in such a) Tj ET
