BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 541.00 Td (to another.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 68.00 522.00 Td (If some of the matters of which I have spoken in the beginning of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 507.00 Td (\223Dioptrics\224 and \223Meteorics\224 should offend at first sight, because I call) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 492.00 Td (them hypotheses and seem indifferent about giving proof of them, I) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 477.00 Td (request a patient and attentive reading of the whole, from which I hope) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 462.00 Td (those hesitating will derive satisfaction; for it appears to me that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 447.00 Td (reasonings are so mutually connected in these treatises, that, as the last) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 432.00 Td (are demonstrated by the first which are their causes, the first are in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 417.00 Td (their turn demonstrated by the last which are their effects. Nor must it) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 402.00 Td (be imagined that I here commit the fallacy which the logicians call a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 387.00 Td (circle; for since experience renders the majority of these effects most) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 372.00 Td (certain, the causes from which I deduce them do not serve so much to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 357.00 Td (establish their reality as to explain their existence; but on the contrary,) Tj ET
