BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 327.00 Td (have I called them hypotheses with any other end in view except that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 312.00 Td (it may be known that I think I am able to deduce them from those first) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 297.00 Td (truths which I have already expounded; and yet that I have expressly) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 282.00 Td (determined not to do so, to prevent a certain class of minds from) Tj ET
